## Resolution

The TLS service's server role in `main` (round 124, 60b995bd): `tls.wit` 1.3 (`listen`, `accept`, `served`), `keystore.wit` 1.7 (`tls-server`, the signer's badge, 120 a minute), `tls/src/device.rs`'s served certificate; `tests/tls_forms_host.rs`. Both TLS groups passed on the maintainer's machines (212d3497), and the gate of round 124's candidate, 45 groups.
